+Create a 1536x1024 landscape AOHYS portfolio first-viewport concept. Exact reference selection is critical: use attached image 4, the Casa Roca live site screenshot. It is the black/dark header with EN/ES selector at upper left, phone “+52 229 153 176” upper right, and a wide blurred nighttime green garden image with a prominent vertical warm timber post. Place that exact entire screenshot as a single direct unchanged rectangular image insert inside a large white softly rounded geometric form. Preserve its image and UI exactly, no repainting, no cropping, no text overlays within it. Do NOT use attached image 3 (the NutriPlan dashboard with teal sidebar and “Categorías de Contenido”). Do NOT use the linen-only image 5. Ambient mood from image 1 only: bright daylight/calm; no interior. Nearly all white space; centered large soft clean geometric white body holds the Casa Roca screenshot, with only a thin outer edge diffraction line in pastel honey #FCE3A6, olive #D6E2B4, apricot #FDD2B1. No colored fill or heavy glow. Text in café brown #473C33, wide margins. Fine humanist sans, thin and precise. Quiet lowercase “aohys” wordmark with subtle joining stroke between o and h; exact name “Alejandro Ortiz Corro”; exact role “full stack development”; exact sentence “Desarrollo productos desde los requisitos hasta la entrega. Mi mayor fortaleza está en frontend.” Exact small nav “Trabajo · Cómo trabajo · Trayectoria · CV · Contacto · EN/ES”. One small primary button “Conoce mi trabajo” in pastel honey. Palette only #FFFFFF, #473C33, #FCE3A6, #D6E2B4, #FDD2B1, button may #FEC868. Airy, bright, quiet, one protagonist. No blue/cyan/violet/mint/black/neon, dark overall background (the embedded site itself has its real dark header), heavy gradients, glassmorphism, ornament, collage, retro, handwriting, pixels, dense grid, people, video, invented metrics, client logos, tech badges, extra claims, extra heading, wrong screenshot, or illegible screenshot. Never print direction name as